# 放到 sln 解决方案所在根目录
# 作用：忽略 VS 生成的缓存、编译二进制文件、用户本地配置，只提交源代码和项目配置

# ====================== 通用系统忽略 ======================
# Windows
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
# Linux
*~

# ===================== 日志、临时文件 =====================
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak

# ====================== VSCode 专用缓存 ======================
.vscode/.env
.vscode/settings.jsonc
# 注意：如果你要保存tasks.json/launch.json到仓库，不要删除下面这行注释
# !.vscode/tasks.json
# !.vscode/launch.json
# !.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
.vscode/**/.git
*.code-workspace
# 临时缓存
.vs/
.vscode/extensions.json
*.log

# ====================== Visual Studio ====================================
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
# 编译产物
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
ARM/
# 项目缓存
*.vcxproj.user
*.csproj.user
# Visual Studio Code（如果你同时用vscode打开这个项目）
.vscode/
# 自定义输出文件夹
bin/
obj/

# NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg


# ====================== CLion / JetBrains IDE 缓存 ================
.idea/
cmake-build-*/
cmake-build-release/
cmake-build-debug/
# 如果你想保留CLion运行配置，取消下面一行注释
# !.idea/runConfigurations/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# ========== CMake 自动生成文件 ==========
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
compile_commands.json

# ========== 可选：如果项目使用vcpkg，取消下面 ==========
# vcpkg/
# vcpkg_installed/


# ====================== Dev-C++ / MinGW 工程文件和临时文件===============
*.dev
makefile.win
*.bak
*.layout
*.depend

# ====================== ASM / C / C++ 汇编、C、C++ ======================
# 编译产物
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.out
*.dll
*.so
*.a
*.lib
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.dylib
*.ilk
*.log
*.exp
# 编译中间文件
*.i
*.s
# 调试文件
*.pdb
*.map
# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake-build-*/
# Dev-C++ / MinGW 临时文件
*.bak
*.layout
*.depend